/Title (Dodgeball- All Play \(1.5x multiplier\) Each round awards points individually, and all points are combined for a final team score. Depending on which order each team's competitor in the round gets out determines their place then their score. The first player to get out will get 6th place, the next player will get 5th place and so on. The winner will get 1st place.  1st place- 4,500 2nd place-3,750 3rd place-3,000 4th place-2,250 5th place- 1,500 6th place- 0)
